  "label": "the text 'this movie sucks' is mapped onto the film production scene",
  "description": "The top text overlay 'this movie sucks' is juxtaposed with the visual of a film set in progress, creating an analogical mapping where the entire film production scene (including the woman in costume and the crew) is being used to represent the 'movie' that is being criticized. The visual material (the film set) is mapped onto the textual entity 'this movie sucks', implying that the current film production is the subject of the criticism.",
